# fl-rifts lifecycle (mod-fl-testbots): one Rift from its opening to the next one.
# Run it on a fixed build (fl-rifts b71422b or later) with no Rift fight in progress: the
# director's first visit to the spawner 90018 (guid 5300694, map 727) after a restart opens a Rift
# of a random element; a Rift that already stands with its first wave (countdown over, nothing
# killed) works the same. Element-agnostic: every Rift is named "Dimensional Rift", and the checks
# count creatures instead of naming entries:
#   `.mmap testarea` = ALIVE creatures within 40 yd of the director ("Found <n> Creatures.") -
#     around the spawner that is the spawner itself, the Rift and its wave or boss (the nearest
#     world spawn stands 90 yd away);
#   `.npc near <yd>` = every creature, corpses included ("... (distance <yd>): <n>").
# Wave creatures spawn within 20 yd of the Rift and the boss 10 yd above them; Xi'ri's Wrath
# (36944: instakill on every attackable enemy within 50 yd and line of sight; the Rift and the
# spawner are not attackable) is cast from the ground and from above, so no creature survives a
# blocked line of sight. Wave corpses stay 60 s (RIFT_CREEP_CORPSE_MS) and are gone before the boss
# dies, so the only corpse left then is the boss's. Its loot (90002: 100 Bloody Trophies 250075,
# The Blood Trails Badge 701008, one item) reaches the director through mod-auto-loot (10 yd, an
# ungrouped player), so the director sweeps a 12-yd grid at the boss's spawn height. The boss dies
# while the director hovers 15 yd above that height: mod-auto-loot calls AllLootRemovedFromCorpse on
# every corpse within 10 yd every 250 ms, and each call halves the corpse's remaining time - a corpse
# next to an ungrouped looter is gone within about 3 s, before the corpse check could see it
# (run 314, 2026-10-03).
# Server.log: "Closing completed Rift." right after the stage 6 line, "Spawned rift ..." 30 minutes
# later during stage 8, "Rift countdown completed ..." two minutes after that.
name    fl-rifts lifecycle - close on the boss kill, boss loot, next Rift with nobody near
timeout 2600s
group none

place 727 12817.3 11967.0 -34.0
require gm alive
as gm .cheat god on
expect output has "Godmode is ON"
wait 3s
as gm .npc near 15
require output has "Dimensional Rift"
log stage 1 - a Rift stands at the spawner; its first wave comes when the countdown ends
wait 125s
as gm .mmap testarea
require output value Found == 12
as gm .npc near 45
log stage 2 - wave 1 stands (10 creatures, the Rift, the spawner); clearing it
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12817.3 11967.0 -20.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12799.3 11949.0 -20.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12835.3 11985.0 -20.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12817.3 11967.0 -34.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
wait 1s
as gm .mmap testarea
require output value Found == 2
log stage 3 - wave 1 cleared; wave 2 comes 10 s later
wait 12s
as gm .mmap testarea
require output value Found == 12
as gm .npc near 45
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12817.3 11967.0 -20.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12799.3 11949.0 -20.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12835.3 11985.0 -20.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
do gm goto 12817.3 11967.0 -34.0
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
wait 1s
as gm .mmap testarea
require output value Found == 2
log stage 4 - wave 2 cleared; the boss comes 10 s later, the wave corpses go after 60 s
wait 70s
as gm .mmap testarea
require output value Found == 3
as gm .npc near 45
require output value ): == 3
log stage 5 - the boss stands and is the only creature besides the Rift and the spawner; killing it from 15 yd above its spawn height
do gm destroy 250075
do gm destroy 701008
do gm goto 12817.3 11967.0 -9.6
wait 500ms
do gm cast 36944 triggered
wait 3s
log stage 6 - 3 s after the boss kill the Rift must be gone and the boss corpse still there
as gm .mmap testarea
require output value Found == 1
as gm .npc near 45
expect output lacks "Dimensional Rift"
expect output value ): == 2
log stage 7 - looting the boss corpse: a 12-yd grid at the boss's spawn height (z -24.6)
do gm goto 12793.3 11943.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12805.3 11943.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12817.3 11943.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12829.3 11943.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12841.3 11943.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12841.3 11955.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12829.3 11955.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12817.3 11955.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12805.3 11955.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12793.3 11955.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12793.3 11967.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12805.3 11967.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12817.3 11967.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12829.3 11967.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12841.3 11967.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12841.3 11979.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12829.3 11979.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12817.3 11979.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12805.3 11979.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12793.3 11979.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12793.3 11991.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12805.3 11991.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12817.3 11991.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12829.3 11991.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
do gm goto 12841.3 11991.0 -24.6
wait 700ms
expect gm item 250075 >= 100
expect gm item 701008 >= 1
log stage 8 - at the hub, 605 yd from the spawner, for 2000 s; the next Rift opens 30 min after the close
place 727 13421.8 11926.1 -32.9
wait 2000s
place 727 12817.3 11967.0 -34.0
wait 3s
log stage 9 - back at the spawner: a new Rift whose first wave already stands (opened while nobody was near)
as gm .npc near 15
expect output has "Dimensional Rift"
as gm .mmap testarea
expect output value Found == 12

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
do gm destroy 250075
do gm destroy 701008
do gm destroy 35584
do gm destroy 35585
do gm destroy 35588
do gm destroy 35589
do gm destroy 35594
do gm destroy 35642
do gm destroy 35646
do gm destroy 41189
